user.description:
Choose the Ninebot scooter to set up.
{note}

⚠️ Confirmed on hardware: MAX G30/G30D (sensors and controls), F40 and Max G3 (sensors only). A Max G3 already paired with the Segway app needs its pairing password entered under Configure. Other models (G2, F2, E-series …) are under active development and may not work yet — reports and diagnostics are welcome.
